{"title":"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/410349baf2b0e584b6b8f81dc1e0e766bfd6021a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin a + \\sin b = \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50b84521e9b492bb345a9d89c375ea06d180123.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos a + \\cos b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da4f2ad5e79d2561ffce68e018d9cd72d67a2de6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (a - b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a66922efb141e4bc0797cd28600a04a7729a56b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{\\frac{5}{3}} - 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac 13\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac 23\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"406\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can make use the of the trigonometric <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometric_identities#Pythagorean_Identities\" title=\"Trigonometric identities\">Pythagorean identities</a>: square both equations and add them up:\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6d5de20ab0bc919b7a7858544f89155541d275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin^2 a + \\sin^2 b + 2\\sin a \\sin b + \\cos^2 a + \\cos^2 b + 2\\cos a \\cos b = \\frac{5}{3} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"519\" height=\"37\" /><br /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2f7e9b21268fc2f419dabe37d0440e8e82c6ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 2\\sin a \\sin b + 2\\cos a \\cos b = \\frac{8}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"260\" height=\"37\" /><br /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f689d46f91ed11c75ff9271ff4741e35ba035df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(\\cos a \\cos b + \\sin a \\sin b) = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"227\" height=\"37\" /></div>\n<p>This is just the cosine difference identity, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7dd65f67e7babbefe32f7298be14e86d64ec45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (a - b) = \\frac{1}{3} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"180\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A\">2007 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">1